      <!-- ─── 2. Shares & Dividends ─── -->
      <section class="doc" id="shares-dividends">
        <header class="section-head">
          <h2>Shares &amp; Dividends</h2>
          <p class="intro">
            How Hana shares are listed and traded, and how the company approaches
            dividends.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="faqgroup">
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">Where are Hana Microelectronics shares listed?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>Hana Microelectronics Public Company Limited is listed on the Stock Exchange of Thailand (SET) under the ticker symbol <strong>HANA</strong>. Shares are denominated and traded in Thai baht (THB).</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">What is Hana's dividend policy?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>[Placeholder] Hana's policy is to pay dividends at a target payout ratio of the company's net profit, subject to the company's financial position, investment plans, and Board approval. Dividend payments are announced to the SET following Board and, where required, shareholder approval.</p>
              <p>Historical dividend records are available on the <a href="/investor-relations/news">Investor News</a> page.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">When does Hana pay dividends?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>[Placeholder] Dividends are typically considered alongside the full-year results and approved at the Annual General Meeting, with payment following the record date set in the SET announcement. Any interim dividend is announced separately.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">Does Hana offer a dividend reinvestment plan?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>[Placeholder] Hana does not currently operate a dividend reinvestment plan. Dividends are paid in cash to registered shareholders.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── 3. Financial Reporting ─── -->
      <section class="doc" id="reporting">
        <header class="section-head">
          <h2>Financial Reporting</h2>
          <p class="intro">
            When and how Hana reports its results, and where to find the
            underlying documents.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="faqgroup">
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">When does Hana's financial year end?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>Hana's financial year runs from 1 January to 31 December. The company reports results on a quarterly basis (Q1–Q4) in line with SET requirements.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">How often does Hana report results?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>Hana publishes quarterly financial statements together with a Management Discussion &amp; Analysis (MD&amp;A), and a full-year Annual Report (Form 56-1 One Report). Each release is announced to the SET and made available on the company's Investor Relations pages.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">Where can I find Hana's annual report and financial statements?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>The latest Annual Report (56-1 One Report) is available on the <a href="/investor-relations/annual">Annual Reports</a> page. Quarterly statements, MD&amp;A, and investor presentations are on the <a href="/investor-relations/news">Investor News</a> page.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">How can I follow Hana's SET announcements?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>All official disclosures are filed with the Stock Exchange of Thailand and republished on our <a href="/investor-relations/news">Investor News</a> page as downloadable documents, grouped by year.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── 4. Company & Listing ─── -->
      <section class="doc" id="company-listing">
        <header class="section-head">
          <h2>Company &amp; Listing</h2>
          <p class="intro">
            Background on the company behind the listing and how to get in touch.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="faqgroup">
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">What does Hana Microelectronics do?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>Hana Microelectronics is an electronics manufacturing services (EMS) and semiconductor assembly &amp; test (OSAT) provider. The group manufactures printed circuit board assemblies, integrated circuit packaging, RFID and smart-tag products, and sensor and optical modules for customers across automotive, industrial, medical, telecommunications, and other markets.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">Where does Hana operate?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>Hana is headquartered in Thailand and operates manufacturing facilities across Thailand, China, Cambodia, and the United States. Details of each site are on the <a href="/locations">Locations</a> pages.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">When was Hana listed on the SET?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>[Placeholder] Hana Microelectronics has been listed on the Stock Exchange of Thailand for over two decades. Listing details and the company's history are summarised in the Annual Report.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq">
            <summary><span class="q">How do I contact the Investor Relations team?</span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div class="a">
              <p>Investor enquiries are handled by the Corporate Affairs team. Contact details and the registered office address are on the <a href="/investor-relations/contact">Investor Events &amp; Contact</a> page.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

